      },
      "writtenOn": "2016-11-18T01:38:28Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "As elsewhere, consider std::vector\u003c\u003e here, to avoid the need to copy. (In this case, it\u0027s less about the amount of data, and more about reducing the number of lines of code to read. The body of the function gets cut in half. :-))",
